PRODUCT_STATE=0xED (Open)  TZEN=0xB4  BOOT_UBE=0xB4 (OEM-iRoT)  SECBOOT_LOCK=0xC3
SECWM watermarks present.  STM32TrustedPackageCreator_CLI present.

## DA credential (ST default, guaranteed-consistent pair)
password.bin = "0123456789012345" (16 bytes, header 00000000 00000080 10000000)
NonCrypto/DA_Config_Password.obk grants permission 14 = "Full Regression".

## Provisioning attempt in the Open state — REJECTED (expected, safe)
$ h5_lock_workflow.sh provision   (WT_LOCK_CONFIRM=1)
