## After the failed provision — board unchanged and healthy
PRODUCT_STATE=0xED (Open), TZEN=0xB4, BOOT_UBE=0xB4 still.
wolfTrust chain still boots: freertos_guest1 heartbeat 3..6 captured on reset.

## Interpretation
DA is provisioned in the Provisioning product state, not Open (standard
STM32H5 OEM-iRoT sequence). Sealing therefore requires a gated state advance
first; no state was advanced. The escape hatch (DA regression) is NOT yet
proven, so advancing product state is deferred to an explicit, spec-verified
hardware session — never on a guess (brick safety).
